Subject: [PATCH 3/8] drm, hls, cbcs, playback: harden FairPlay CBCS retries,
 HLS selection and full-song validation

Add in-flight DRM backend guards, CBCS fragment retry backoff and deferred init flush, Atmos preference and full-song duration validation, and container/extension/source-version metadata fields.

